       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TSTHELLO.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  EXPECTED-MESSAGE PIC X(13) VALUE "Hello, world!".
       01  FAILURE-COUNT PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       COPY HELLOMSG.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM TEST-HAPPY-PATH

           IF FAILURE-COUNT = ZERO
               DISPLAY "PASS GREETER HAPPY PATH"
               MOVE ZERO TO RETURN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
           END-IF

           STOP RUN.

       TEST-HAPPY-PATH.
           MOVE SPACES TO HELLO-RESPONSE
           CALL "GREETER" USING HELLO-RESPONSE

           IF HELLO-MESSAGE NOT = EXPECTED-MESSAGE
               ADD 1 TO FAILURE-COUNT
               DISPLAY "FAIL GREETER HAPPY PATH"
               DISPLAY "  EXPECTED: " EXPECTED-MESSAGE
               DISPLAY "  ACTUAL:   " HELLO-MESSAGE
           END-IF.

       END PROGRAM TSTHELLO.
